{{D|Knockdown}} is a [[Status Effect]] that causes enemies to be knocked prone to the ground, leaving them vulnerable.

*Against enemies, [[Finisher#Ground Finisher|Ground Finishers]] will prompt.
*Against players, they become staggered into a backward roll animation.
**Right after being knocked down, the Warframe will flash in their energy colors briefly. Jumping or rolling during the flash will allow the Warframe to stand up or roll more quickly, allowing players to act earlier.
**A player's open {{Keybind|Esc}} menu will be abruptly closed if knocked down.

[[File:U272StaggerVideo.mp4|400px|right|Demonstrating self-stagger mechanics]]
Knockdown and stagger animations will not be played when a player successfully resists a knockdown or stagger. Knockdown resistance can be obtained through any of the means mentioned in the section on [[Knockdown#Sources of Knockdown Resistance|sources of knockdown resistance]].

